  m_text: '<b>Teleport</b>  Point at the floor and release Grip.

    <b>Glass door</b> 
    Grab the door handle and pull or push.

    <b>Flashlight</b>  Take it from its
    dock, pull the Trigger to switch it on.

    <b>Generator</b>  Plug a power cell
    (tube) into the top of the generator.

    <b>Chess</b>  Place a chess piece
    on one of the centre squares.

    <b>Menu</b>  Press A or Menu at any time to
    open this panel.'
